===Etymology===
Name of the Norwegian mathematician {{w|Niels Henrik Abel|Abel}} {{suffix|en||-ian}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/əˈbi.li.ən/|/əˈbil.jən/|/əˈbiːlɪən/|a=US}}
